All three themes now: palette-as-data + `assembleCss`, divergent private var names deleted (`--bone/--witness/--slab`, `--text/--bg/--mid*`, `--paper/--mid`), values preserved so each keeps its identity: - `@emsenn/561-group-website-theme` (`fiveSixOnePalette`) â€” drives **research** + 561.group. - `sites/emsenn.net` (`emsennPalette`, light+dark) â€” its two `:root` blocks collapsed into one palette; dark mode now falls out of the data. - `sites/koios.news` (`koiosPalette`, light+dark) â€” same.

